{{smaller block|Vanish; or I shall give thee thy deserving,<br>And ''blemish'' Cæsar’s triumph. {{right|''Shak.'', A. and C., iv. 10.}}
Sin is a soil which ''blemisheth'' the beauty of thy soul.
